      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't know if it's the same issue we're having but when I unlock gestures, people see me do animation gestures even if my whole avatar is set to tracking for index. Then when they unshow and show my avatar, they see me tracking again. It's frustrating because I tend to gesture a lot and people just don't see it untill I tell them that.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
