      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes it's exactly the same behavior. So if others have that issue too it's very unlikely avatar related? I tried turning hand gestures back on and off again, but that didn't \"unlock\" fingertracking. For my friends who knows about that issue they have to deshow and reshow me for make it work on their side. So VRC is not sending the information how it should.\n\nI myself use full index and body tracking. And yes I gesture a lot too just to hear. I never saw your fingers move for month, not once. He didn't even know I had fingertracking. Super frustrating.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
