      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yesterday I met another person where now I couldn't see the fingertracking and it was the actual Quest 3 fingertracking and not the Index controller like I use. Also a complete different avatar as mine. So seems it's a fingertracking issue in general and most likely on VRChat side.",
